  "text": "Dr. Eyob Mamo is an Ethiopian author, life coach, and leadership trainer known for his work in personal development and self-improvement. Based in Addis Ababa, he focuses on raising the next generation of leaders through books, seminars, and digital training. Professional Background Education: He earned a degree in organizational management, a master's in education curriculum"
